      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1199390442908251436, guid: e20631cd1f1624d4785fddc3eb45725d, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLines.Array.data[0].text
      value: "Psychological Evaluation Summary \u2014 Asset #5682\r\n\r\nSubject,
        whose full legal name is Mars [REDACTED], exhibits a persistent tendency
        toward imaginative cognition, characterized by internal narrative construction,
        complex metaphorical reasoning,and emotional framing of objective stimuli.\r\n\r\nWhile
        not inherently detrimental, these traits present long-term risks to behavioral
        standardization if left unregulated.\r\n\r\nSubject consistently demonstrates
        a need to assign meaning to actions beyond task parameters, and displays
        a significant inclination towards self-reflection during active operations,
        resulting in loss of efficiency to varying degrees.\r\n\r\nIt is recommended
        to continue maintaining variability within acceptable limits to preserve
        perceived autonomy. Avoid direct suppression of imaginative cognition, as
        this may lead to premature behavioral collapse and total loss of efficiency.
        \r\n\r\nThis subject\u2019s inclination towards cognitive divergence should
        be contained, redirected, and closely observed.\r\n"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1199390442908251436, guid: e20631cd1f1624d4785fddc3eb45725d, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLines.Array.data[1].text
      value: yes :>
